    {
      "id": "u_24710eea88cd35eafa64e275_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Unlike __TRILIUM_PH_0__Custom Widgets__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the process of setting up a launch bar widget is slightly different:",
